# Vendored Interledger RFCs (ADR 0062). Everything below each file's
# `<!-- BEGIN VERBATIM UPSTREAM BODY -->` marker is the Interledger Foundation's
# text, reproduced byte for byte under CC BY-SA 4.0 on the stated condition that
# it is unmodified -- and reformatting is modification. A preface and its body
# live in one file and cannot be ignored separately, so the directory is ignored
# whole. `crates/connector-bin/tests/vendored_rfcs_are_unmodified.rs` catches it
# if this rule is ever lost (it already caught prettier once).
docs/rfcs

# The toon client's own store, written by `local/anyone/run.sh` inside a
# container and owned by that container's uid. Gitignored already
# (local/anyone/.gitignore), but prettier walks the working tree rather than
# the index and exits non-zero on a file it cannot read.
local/*/.store
